  "html": "<a href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/IMG_20240317_124609.jpg\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"9248\" height=\"6936\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/IMG_20240317_124609.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/IMG-20240401-WA0139-scaled.jpg\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"400\" height=\"284\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/IMG-20240401-WA0139-400x284.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/WhatsApp-Image-2024-04-01-at-16.05.40.jpeg\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"400\" height=\"284\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/WhatsApp-Image-2024-04-01-at-16.05.40-400x284.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/WhatsApp-Image-2024-04-01-at-16.05.39-2.jpeg\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"400\" height=\"284\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/WhatsApp-Image-2024-04-01-at-16.05.39-2-400x284.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/IMG-20240401-WA0125-scaled.jpg\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"400\" height=\"284\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/IMG-20240401-WA0125-400x284.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/IMG_20240317_121919.jpg\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"9248\" height=\"6936\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/IMG_20240317_121919.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/WhatsApp-Image-2024-04-01-at-16.00.39-3.jpeg\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"400\" height=\"284\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/WhatsApp-Image-2024-04-01-at-16.00.39-3-400x284.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<p>Alhamdulillah Relawan Nusantara bisa memantau langsung proses persiapan pengiriman <em>food basket</em> di gudang yang ada di Mesir untuk dikirim ke Gaza.<em> Food basket</em> yang berisikan beras, keju, minyak, selai, roti, kurma, teh, makanan kaleng, <em>butter</em>, kacang merah, dan sarden. <em>Food basket</em> ini sudah siap untuk dikirimkan ke Gaza.</p>\n<p>Bantuan ini kami harapkan dapat memberikan manfaat untuk saudara kita di Palestina.</p>\n<p>Terima kasih kami ucapkan kepada para donatur yang telah menitipkan donasi kepada kami untuk saudara kita di Palestina.</p>\n<p>Jangan berhanti untuk terus mendoakan dan mendukung perjuangan Sahabat kita di Palestina.</p>\n<p>Sahabat masih bisa terus menyalurkan bantuan untuk Palestina melalui dengan cara klik “bantu Palestina sekarang”</p>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"/campaign/programs?category=Palestin&amp;source=web\" data-button=\"true\">Bantu Palestina Sekarang</a>",
